  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and the median of the following ten numbers in increasing order <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>22</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>26</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>29</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>34</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>42</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>67</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>70</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>y</mi></math> are <math><mn>42</mn></math> and <math><mn>35</mn></math> respectively, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to:",
